  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAZ- Gender in politics - KAZ Gender in politics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KAZ- J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet i pol</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A cooperation between women and men in politics will be initiated on gender issues.Strategies will be developed on how to get more women involved in politics. Women and men in politics will take steps for investigations on the gender reasons of men&apos;s low life expectancy. Women in business shall get strengthened; existing local Resource Centres for training of women in business shall get developed.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
  </description>
